          "settings": {
            "kicker": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<p>No stimulants, so nothing to feel in the first hour and nothing to come down from at four o'clock. Most people describe the afternoon dip going in weeks three to four; wearable data typically moves between day 30 and day 60.</p>"
          }
        },
        "ch_judge": {
